  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3ee5cec81053b674fb3a57ae57f9916d, type: 3}
  m_Name: Breadcrumb Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - Great work! You can place troops on various spots to counter the toasts, use
    your breadcrumbs to hire them.
  - Toasts drop breadcrumbs after being defeated. The more breadcrumbs the more troops!
  - "Oh, sugar honey iced tea- more waves of toasts are coming through, I\u2019ll
    give you this extra card for more allies."
